{
  "slug": "langguard-scope-mcp",
  "name": "Langguard Scope Mcp",
  "type": "plugin",
  "description": "SCOPE - Security, Compliance & Operational Policy Evaluation - A Claude plugin that runs deterministic pre-flight compliance evaluation on agentic workflows. Maps every MCP tool to risk level, business impact, and 25 regulatory regimes like SOC 2, GDPR, HIPAA, PCI, SOX, the EU AI Act — before the agent ships.",
  "longDescription": "Ships **3 skills** and **1 MCP server**.\n\n- **Skills** (3): `audit` (Use this skill ONLY when the user explicitly invokes `/scope-mcp:audit` (or asks for a \"compliance audit\")), `compliance-check` (Use proactively when the user is DESIGNING or BUILDING an agent / Cowork plugin / agentic workflow —…), `curate` (Use when the user wants to create or refresh a YAML compliance data file for a single MCP…)\n- **MCP servers** (1): `scope-mcp`\n\nInstalls with `claude plugin install langguard-scope-mcp@claude-community` from `LangGuard-AI/scope-mcp` (`plugins/scope-mcp`).",
  "compatibility": [
    "claude",
    "copilot",
    "codex"
  ],
